y possible** due to missing B6.\n\nSo despite being listed as valid, they are not logically valid.\n\nHence, safest and only real option is **Pass**.\n\nReason: Neither Chi B5 nor Chi B6 can be formed with current hand tiles (lacking B6), making them invalid despite appearing in the list; thus, the only feasible action is to pass.\n\nAnswer: Pass"}
